# SPDX licence ids the built-in YARA pack may ship (#6263 W03b, spec §5 step 5).
#
# A rule is kept only when its repository licence (as YARA Forge embeds it)
# AND any per-rule `meta: license` both classify to an id listed here. A rule
# with no licence is dropped. filter.go refuses any id outside its permissive
# ceiling (Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, CC0-1.0): GPL, DRL,
# Elastic License, CC-BY and non-commercial terms cannot be enabled from here.
# Changing this file changes the pack: bump `version` in pack.lock.
Apache-2.0
MIT
BSD-2-Clause
BSD-3-Clause
CC0-1.0
